10. Repository-mutating producers use per-Story worktrees. Resolve the base
    from configured `integration_base_branch`, else one uniquely tracked remote
    HEAD, else the current branch only when no remotes exist. Fetch a configured
    upstream and compare exact OIDs; ahead/diverged/unreadable/ambiguous
    authority refuses, and only a positively upstream-free branch uses its
